<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #211d18;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 28px 12px;
        }

        .email-card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #fffaf2;
            border: 1px solid #e4d6c3;
            border-radius: 18px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(33, 29, 24, 0.10);
        }

        .hero {
            background: #11100e;
            padding: 38px 34px 34px;
            color: #f5eee3;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            color: #c4703a;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin: 0 0 14px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
            font-size: 38px;
            line-height: 1.02;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }

        .hero-copy {
            margin: 16px 0 0;
            color: rgba(245, 238, 227, 0.72);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 480px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 34px;
        }

        .content p {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            color: #5f574c;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .panel {
            background: #f1e6d7;
            border: 1px solid #e2d2bd;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 22px;
            margin: 26px 0;
        }

        .panel-title {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            color: #211d18;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .benefit {
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(33, 29, 24, 0.10);
            color: #433b32;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        .benefit:first-of-type {
            border-top: 0;
        }

        .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #c4703a;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 15px 24px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        }

        .note {
            margin-top: 24px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eadfce;
            color: #8a7c6d;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #11100e;
            color: rgba(245, 238, 227, 0.56);
            padding: 24px 34px;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #c4703a;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        @media only screen and (max-width: 520px) {
            .hero,
            .content,
            .footer {
                padding-left: 22px;
                padding-right: 22px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 31px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <table class="wrapper" role="presentation" width="100%">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <table class="email-card" role="presentation">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="hero">
                            <p class="eyebrow">Easy Jackets Newsletter</p>
                            <h1>You are on the list.</h1>
                            <p class="hero-copy">
                                Thanks for subscribing. We will send the good stuff: new drops, custom jacket ideas,
                                limited offers, and notes from the design studio.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="content">
                            <p>
                                Welcome to Easy Jackets. Your inbox now gets first look at varsity jackets, hoodies,
                                patches, embroidery ideas, and seasonal deals before they hit the regular crowd.
                            </p>

                            <div class="panel">
                                <div class="panel-title">What to expect</div>
                                <div class="benefit">Early access to jacket releases and limited collections.</div>
                                <div class="benefit">Subscriber-only discounts, flash sale alerts, and bulk-order offers.</div>
                                <div class="benefit">Styling, customization, patch, and embroidery inspiration.</div>
                                <div class="benefit">Behind-the-scenes updates from the Easy Jackets team.</div>
                            </div>

                            <p>
                                Ready to start browsing? Explore ready-made jackets or jump into the design studio when
                                you want something made just for you.
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin: 26px 0 0;">
                                <a href="https://easyjackets.com/shop" class="cta">Explore Jackets</a>
                            </p>

                            <div class="note">
                                This confirmation was sent to <strong><%= data.email %></strong>. If you did not
                                subscribe, you can safely ignore this email.
                            </div>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="footer">
                            <strong style="color:#f5eee3;">Easy Jackets</strong><br>
                            Custom varsity jackets, patches, embroidery, and team orders.<br>
                            <a href="https://easyjackets.com">easyjackets.com</a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>

</html>
